{70}{I was-s-s but a s-s-small girl living in a tiny village. One day a band of halfling marauders attacked our village and managed to kill all the men and any woman who fought them. My mother was-s-s one who did. They took the timid women and children as-s-s s-s-slaves and made us walk all the way to the town of Ragnavol. I was-s-s sold to a weaver who beat me whenever I did not work fas-s-st enough for him.}{I was-s-s but a s-s-small girl living in a tiny village. One day a band of halfling marauders attacked our village and managed to kill all the men and any woman who fought them. My mother was-s-s one who did. They took the timid women and children as-s-s s-s-slaves and made us walk all the way to the town of Ragnavol. I was-s-s sold to a weaver who beat me whenever I did not work fas-s-st enough for him.}{}{}{}{}
