{72}{But at night, he would take me to his-s-s bedchamber and us-s-se me. S-s-sometimes-s-s he would us-s-se me like a girl, and s-s-sometimes-s-s like a boy. When I told his-s-s wife about this-s-s, s-s-she beat me hard, then held me while did things-s-s to me. Terrible things-s-s. One day I tried to run away. All the men in the town hunted me down and took me back to him.}{But at night, he would take me to his-s-s bedchamber and us-s-se me. S-s-sometimes-s-s he would us-s-se me like a girl, and s-s-sometimes-s-s like a boy. When I told his-s-s wife about this-s-s, s-s-she beat me hard, then held me while did things-s-s to me. Terrible things-s-s. One day I tried to run away. All the men in the town hunted me down and took me back to him.}{}{}{}{}
