{74}{The entire town watched as I was-s-s stripped naked and flogged until I fainted three times-s-s. And they delighted in my pain. I recovered, and lived with the knowledge they hated me for being human. I was-s-s taller than they were, and was-s-s hated for it. I was-s-s prettier than they were and was-s-s hated for it. I learned to hide it but I hated them back.}{The entire town watched as I was-s-s stripped naked and flogged until I fainted three times-s-s. And they delighted in my pain. I recovered, and lived with the knowledge they hated me for being human. I was-s-s taller than they were, and was-s-s hated for it. I was-s-s prettier than they were and was-s-s hated for it. I learned to hide it but I hated them back.}{}{}{}{}
