{76}{In the summer of my 15th or 16th year, I learned my mas-s-ster was-s-s going to let the other men of the town us-s-se me as-s-s a whore. But on that night, another man bought me and took me away. Davro, was-s-s his name. He was-s-s kind to me, thought I was-s-s beautiful, and I grew to love him. But one day I relis-s-sed he was no longer interes-s-sted in me. I was-s-s no longer young enough.}{In the summer of my 15th or 16th year, I learned my mas-s-ster was-s-s going to let the other men of the town us-s-se me as-s-s a whore. But on that night, another man bought me and took me away. Davro, was-s-s his name. He was-s-s kind to me, thought I was-s-s beautiful, and I grew to love him. But one day I relis-s-sed he was no longer interes-s-sted in me. I was-s-s no longer young enough.}{}{}{}{}
{77}{[You listen]}{}{1}{}{78}{}
